WEBVTT

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.171
Here is the whole run.

00:00:07.171 --> 00:00:12.087
For the first 70 generations or so, the best networks simply stood still.

00:00:12.087 --> 00:00:13.722
The trap held.

00:00:14.322 --> 00:00:21.055
Then, around generation 69, a network found a slow shuffle that moved forward without falling.

00:00:21.055 --> 00:00:25.646
Its score jumped above zero, and the population followed.

00:00:26.246 --> 00:00:29.992
The champion passed 100 at generation 99.

00:00:29.992 --> 00:00:40.466
The scores had levelled off, so from generation 430 each network got 5 terrains instead of three, and the population grew to 300.

00:00:40.466 --> 00:00:46.347
After 674 generations, its average on ten unseen terrains is 200.

00:00:46.947 --> 00:00:53.785
Here are the champions side by side, each on a typical terrain: the middle one of its ten test terrains.

00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:57.748
From a random network, to a shuffle, to a real walk.

00:00:58.348 --> 00:01:01.678
And this is the final champion.

00:01:06.348 --> 00:01:09.304
While the scores rose, the networks grew.

00:01:09.304 --> 00:01:16.000
The violet line counts hidden nodes in use, and the amber line counts layers from input to output.

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:22.275
The champion has 6 hidden nodes in 5 hidden layers, and only 37 connections.

00:01:22.275 --> 00:01:27.410
It started with eight hidden nodes in one layer and 224 connections.

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:33.723
Evolution threw most of them away, and stacked what was left into a deeper chain.

00:01:34.323 --> 00:01:36.567
This is the number of species.

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:46.848
A setting called the compatibility threshold decides how different two networks must be to count as separate species, and the code tunes it to aim for about ten.

00:01:47.448 --> 00:01:57.073
In the first hour, that tuning ran away. neat python never merges species, so the count barely fell, and the threshold kept climbing, to thirty eight.

00:01:57.073 --> 00:02:02.246
It is now kept within limits, and the run continued from its checkpoint.
